  "description": "FFmpeg 8.1.3's shared libraries for win-x64, built for decoding only (no encoders or muxers; yadif the only filter; zlib and dav1d for PNG and AV1 linked in), so ShotDetector decodes and probes in-process: faster and with about half the memory of the ffmpeg executable, with the same results. LGPL-2.1-or-later, as FFmpeg (dav1d: BSD-2-Clause); the build recipe is configure.txt in the package.",
